  "decisions": [
    "Only Phase005 is authorized; currentPhase=6 after seal does not authorize Phase006.",
    "The current card references absent original examples. Freeze local dates as YYYY年M月D日, ranges separated by ～ with spaces, equal dates once; reject reversed/invalid Gregorian dates. No locale/timezone/current-clock dependency.",
    "Duration: 0分钟,45分钟,1小时30分钟,2小时. Decimal money: CNY ¥1,234.00 / USD $1,234.00, string/BigInt ROUND_HALF_EVEN at two fraction digits, no Number conversion or requirement-budget integer-size cap.",
    "CostEstimate keeps all eight canonical fields and full FactFreshness. Unknown shows 未知; free 免费; estimated carries 估算; verified_estimate carries 已核验估算; stale carries 已过期/待核验. No unknown-as-zero rendering.",
    "truncate uses Unicode code points and its limit includes the ellipsis; zero returns empty and invalid lengths throw RangeError.",
    "Components use the props explicitly recoverable from this card: LoadingState label?, EmptyState title/description?/action?, ErrorState message/onRetry?, PageHeader title/actions?, plus className. ErrorState has the first-line use client directive formatted with project-required double quotes.",
    "Phase003 bootstrap content is retained as a versioned fixture and moved homepage. The site wrapper is a div to avoid nesting its existing main landmark; p-gutter and wide:max-w-5xl remain exact.",
    "No real admin pages exist. A production matcher mutation is observable through the mandated empty-body requirement even when the missing route also returns status 404.",
    "Prior completion rows are immutable candidate records; admission relies on the actual double-shell Phase004 seal and synced metadata, not retroactive edits to old logs."
  ],
